{"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\u0022hits\u0022:[{\u0022noteId\u0022:\u0022a58b5d35-f8d7-473f-ba12-44283c288075\u0022,\u0022content\u0022:\u0022Damian Tarnowski is a programmer from Poland working on AIObro\\u0144ca, an AI system for automating legal support. He also uses LLM Memory to retain context across interactions.\u0022,\u0022score\u0022:0.03278688524590164,\u0022relatedEntityIds\u0022:[\u0022352b4909-09da-4b0a-9050-ca6e46a6c42b\u0022,\u0022478ad65e-198b-4664-a96b-180d96331751\u0022,\u0022979d316a-3e44-4312-9540-3d75a651b3df\u0022,\u0022a48a1e59-508d-45ac-b351-283a5507eb18\u0022,\u0022b4234c8a-4c64-45b1-8ae9-b63089bbabb3\u0022,\u0022d8f9f265-4596-46e4-b00f-854d818dac42\u0022]},{\u0022noteId\u0022:\u0022cb62c322-5876-497c-b151-dab8d5171b41\u0022,\u0022content\u0022:\u0022LLM Memory is a second-brain memory system for AI assistants built by Damian. It uses .NET 10, PostgreSQL with pgvector, and Apache AGE for storage and graph reasoning, while Anthropic Claude handles chat and OpenAI provides embeddings.\u0022,\u0022score\u0022:0.016129032258064516,\u0022relatedEntityIds\u0022:[\u00220e5fdd55-1183-4e2f-9cc5-78b4a5892a1a\u0022,\u002219ce6b41-c26d-46d9-a03d-2559f459370b\u0022,\u0022205d82ec-44b2-43ea-8e19-faec17b8f920\u0022,\u002221050859-b088-4f0f-acfe-8d3ac1e5ff83\u0022,\u0022623f7d7c-8ef6-4a0c-b7ff-017212bdace4\u0022,\u0022c15386e3-3fd4-44ca-aa10-2d9dc09a5900\u0022,\u0022d8f9f265-4596-46e4-b00f-854d818dac42\u0022,\u0022eb2deb81-7cde-4e4a-b637-7b12b55a09c2\u0022,\u0022efaa1c86-dda8-472f-ad45-e5192ae4c107\u0022]},{\u0022noteId\u0022:\u0022c3e4ba23-35b9-44cb-9865-dbf9d14fa9ca\u0022,\u0022content\u0022:\u0022llm memory is a second-brain memory system for ai assistants built by damian. Its stack combines .net 10, postgresql with pgvector, and apache age, while using anthropic claude for chat and openai for embeddings.\u0022,\u0022score\u0022:0.015873015873015872,\u0022relatedEntityIds\u0022:[\u00220e5fdd55-1183-4e2f-9cc5-78b4a5892a1a\u0022,\u002219ce